direction: right
Producers: Event producers {shape: rectangle}
Stream: Event stream {shape: queue}
Processor: Stream processors {shape: rectangle}
HotStore: Real-time store {shape: stored_data}
Lake: Object storage {shape: stored_data}
Aggregator: Batch aggregator {shape: rectangle}
Warehouse: Analytics warehouse {shape: cylinder}
Dashboard: Live dashboard {shape: page}
Producers -> Stream
Stream -> Processor
Processor -> HotStore
Processor -> Lake
HotStore -> Dashboard: live metrics
Lake -> Aggregator
Aggregator -> Warehouse
Warehouse -> Dashboard: historical
